Clause 18: `(x(1, 1, 1) ∨ ¬x(2, 0, 0))`.
Clause 17: `(¬x(1, 1, 2) ∨ x(1, 1, 0))`.
Clause 16: `(¬x(1, 1, 2) ∨ x(1, 1, 0))`.
