*   **Clause 6:** $(\neg x(2, 0, 0) \lor x(2, 2, 1))$ -> "Xylon does not develop solar during the day OR Xylon develops antimatter at night."
*   **Clause 7:** $(\neg x(2, 2, 1) \lor x(0, 1, 1))$ -> "Xylon does not develop antimatter at night OR Vulcan develops nuclear at night."

