*   **Clause 19 (from readable_cnf):** `(x(1, 3, 1) ∨ ¬x(1, 4, 1) ∨ x(0, 4, 2) ∨ x(2, 3, 1))`
    *   This clause repeats the requirement from Clause 17.

*   **Clause 20 (from readable_cnf):** `(¬x(1, 3, 1) ∨ ¬x(1, 4, 1) ∨ x(0, 4, 2) ∨ x(2, 3, 1))`
    *   This clause repeats the requirement from Clause 16.

*   **Clause 21 (from readable_cnf):** `(x(1, 3, 1) ∨ ¬x(1, 4, 1) ∨ x(0, 4, 2) ∨ x(2, 3, 1))`
    *   This clause repeats the requirement from Clause 19.

*   **Clause 22 (from readable_cnf):** `(¬x(1, 3, 1) ∨ ¬x(1, 4, 1) ∨ x(0, 4, 2) ∨ x(2, 3, 1))`
    *   This clause repeats the requirement from Clause 20.

*   **Clause 23 (from readable_cnf):** `(x(1, 3, 1) ∨ ¬x(1, 4, 1) ∨ x(0, 4, 2) ∨ x(2, 3, 1))`
    *   This clause repeats the requirement from Clause 21.

*   **Clause 24 (from readable_cnf):** `(¬x(1, 3, 1) ∨ ¬x(1, 4, 1) ∨ x(0, 4, 2) ∨ x(2, 3, 1))`
